  "goodToKnow": "Die Anatomie is anatomy, a cornerstone of medical study: im Präpkurs, German medical students dissect bodies. German anatomist Gunther von Hagens invented plastination, and his touring exhibition Körperwelten (Body Worlds) has drawn millions of visitors and much controversy. Anatomisch means anatomical: anatomisch geformt (ergonomically shaped). From Greek anatome (dissection). Stressed on the last syllable."
